WEBVTT

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.440
Because I was always alone...

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:10.320
I didn't really think dying
from an illness was scary.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.320
But now it's different...

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.990
There are days I want to protect,
and precious people I have to make happy.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.920
I'm living for all of you now.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.000
It's okay to smile.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.250
That's how we can stay strong.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.460
That's what I thought...

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.970
because I'm your master.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:39.470
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.890
Yes... so far, everything is all right.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.020
Alright.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.190
In the time I've been away,

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.020
I haven't yet been caught by
the Administrative Bureau.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.690
Is Master Hayate lonely?

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.360
If she is, she hasn't mentioned it to me.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:05.030
But her friends are visiting her a lot...
Suzuka-chan and the others.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.040
I see.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.370
We can't let her worry about us.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:11.040
I'll return in a few days.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.540
Okay. Be careful.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:14.210
Yeah.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:22.800
Sixty... Just sixty pages left.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.820
Here we are, everyone.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.660
Looks delicious!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.910
Wow...

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:48.950
Right?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:50.620
Let's eat!

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.420
Fate-chan, please help yourself
to as much as you'd like.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:56.420
Yes... thank you very much!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.710
Here you go, Nanoha.
Your plate.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:00.340
Thanks.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.260
Miyuki, you've become
much better at cooking!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.970
Here you go, Fate-chan.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.180
Thank you.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:15.650
Fate-chan, how about you? Spending
Christmas with your family this year?

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.400
Yes...

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.070
I guess you could say that...

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.690
Is that so?

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:24.780
It'll be another brutal Christmas Eve for us.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:28.620
I'll make the price tags and put
together the pop-up boxes tonight.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.370
Thanks for that.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.870
We all need a good night's sleep tonight.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.420
Christmas cakes at Midoriya

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:40.550
are really popular, so we always have
lots of customers on Christmas Eve.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:45.090
And for those who spend Christmas Eve
with their lovers or friends,

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.300
we stay open a lot later than usual.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.510
Is that so?

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.220
Must be nice for you, Kyouya-chan!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.100
Since you'll be working together with
Shinobu-san <i>all day</i> at the store!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.520
That has nothing to do with anything!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:01.070
We'll keep the ones for Arisa-chan's
and Suzuka-chan's families separate.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:01.780
Okay!

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.110
For Lindy-san as well,
since she also ordered one.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:05.990
Look forward to it.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.120
Okay!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.540
Thank you... very much.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:19.040
<i>About tomorrow, when we're going home
after the school's closing ceremony...</i>

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:23.050
<i>Are you all still free?</i>

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.760
<i>We're going to deliver
Hayate's presents, right?</i>

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:36.020
<i>I wonder if it's really all right
to make this a surprise...</i>

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:42.280
<i>Well, even if it's inconvenient, we can just
have Dr. Ishida give them to her for us.</i>

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:46.320
<i>Then, in that case... see you tomorrow.</i>

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.240
<i>Good night...!</i>

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.120
Send!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.520
Huh? What's the matter, Chrono-kun?

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.270
Ah... I was just looking up some stuff.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.110
Aw, if you had just told me,
I would've done it for you.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:27.110
No, it's all right.
It's... a little personal.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:36.160
Ah, did you send Yuuno's findings on the
Book of Darkness to Nanoha and Fate?

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:41.170
Nanoha-chan and Fate-chan have
mixed feelings about its past and all...

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.420
I see...

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:52.550
Hayate, I'm sorry about not
being able to come visit you much...

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:55.890
It's all right.
Have you been well?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.680
Totally well!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.400
Hello...

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.440
Huh? That sounds like Suzuka-chan!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.900
Please come in!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.900
Hello!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.950
So, everyone's here today?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.910
Hello, nice to meet you all!

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.210
Ah, please forgive us.
Are we interrupting something?

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.630
No... not at all.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.220
Welcome, everyone.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.220
Oh, thank goodness.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.220
So, what brings you all here today?

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.400
One, two...

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.150
Surprise presents!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:55.240
Since today's Christmas Eve,
we brought you some Christmas presents.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.620
Really?

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.790
Thank you so much!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.870
We picked these out together!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.960
Be sure to open them later.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:04.710
I will!

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.930
Nanoha-chan, Fate-chan...

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:14.930
What's wrong?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.720
N-Nothing... it's nothing...

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:20.890
We were just a little surprised
with everyone here... right?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.310
Right...

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:27.520
Ah, everyone... I'll take your coats.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.070
Thanks!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:37.120
I can't use telepathy.
Are you jamming?

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.490
Shamal's support skills are superb.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.500
At this range, this is nothing for her.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.210
Umm... uh...

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:50.000
You don't have to scowl at me like that...

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.720
I'm not scowling!
This is just how I look!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.050
Vita! Don't lie.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.560
This is what bad girls get.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.730
Is it all right if we hang
out with her for a bit first?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.730
That's fine.

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.820
Goodbye!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:21.410
What's wrong, Vita?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.660
It's... nothing.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:26.870
Really?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.760
I wonder if it'll snow tonight...

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.940
Hayate-chan is the master
of the Book of Darkness.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.690
It's not long until her
wish can be granted.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.110
If you're going to interfere...
Even if you're Hayate-chan's friends...

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.360
Wait! Please wait a second!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:09:59.870
Listen to what we have to say!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.490
You can't do this!

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.870
If the Book of Darkness is
completed, Hayate-chan will...!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:12.670
Nanoha!

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.890
If you informed the Administrative
Bureau of our master's identity,

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:24.680
that'd be a problem.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:29.980
I can't let you escape my jamming barrier.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.480
Vita... -chan...

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:41.490
Don't you dare interfere.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.120
We're so close to saving her!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:49.920
Hayate will come back to us...
happy and healthy!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:53.420
We've been working so desperately!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.800
There's only a little bit left, so...

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.930
Don't interfere!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.540
You devil...

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:36.880
I'm fine with becoming a devil...

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.970
Accel Mode.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.350
Drive Ignition.

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:57.020
I'll just use my hellish tools
to get you to listen!

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:22.380
Shamal, stay back and concentrate
on maintaining the jamming barrier.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:23.720
Got it.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:34.900
The Book of Darkness was altered and
corrupted by someone with evil intentions.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:39.070
If you complete it now, Hayate will...

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:43.610
In a sense, we are part
of the Book of Darkness!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:53.080
Which is why we obviously
know everything about it!

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:55.210
Then, why...?!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.250
Accel Shooter.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.720
Why do you call it the "Book of Darkness"?!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.640
Why don't you call it by its real name?

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:11.640
Its... real name...?

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.270
Barrier Jacket.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.730
Sonic Form.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.410
Haken.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.090
So you made your light armor even lighter.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.760
I can move that much faster because of it.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.720
Even a glancing blow would be fatal.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.680
Are you crazy, Testarossa?

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.060
This is so I can defeat you.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:56.690
With how strong you are,
this is all I can do to face you!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:23.210
Had we not met like this...
we may have become good friends.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.710
There's still time for that!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:30.970
Stop...

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:40.980
We guardian knights made a decision.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.980
That we'd even throw away our
honor to save our master's smile.

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.490
You can't stop us anymore!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.240
You will be stopped...

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.070
by me and Bardiche.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.450
Yes, sir.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:59.670
<i>I can't get in touch with anyone!</i>

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.960
<i>What happened?!</i>

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:09.760
It has a real name, doesn't it?

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:13.050
The real name of the Book of Darkness...?

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.860
A bind!?

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:25.650
Again!?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.440
Nanoha!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.120
Plasma Lancer.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:46.880
There!

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.770
Things won't go the same way as last time!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.910
Two of them?!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.970
What... is this?!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:41.100
With this many, the binds and
jamming barrier won't last too long.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.480
Please take care of them quickly.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.230
Right.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.070
When did you...?!

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:22.810
The last few pages will be filled by the
useless guardian knights themselves.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.980
As has always happened before.

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:28.610
Just as it should.

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:30.190
Collecting.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.120
The cursed and broken Lost Logia...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:55.130
There's no way you could
save anyone with this...

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.800
Shamal! Signum!

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:02.640
Who... who are you two?!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:10.020
There's no reason a mere
program should know.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.410
Right... there was another, wasn't there?

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.300
Steal it...

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:36.590
Collecting.

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:04.240
Those two... are Nanoha
and Fate taken care of?

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:07.250
They're locked in forty binds
and a Crystal Cage.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.710
It'll take them a few
minutes to get out of that.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.960
Plenty of time.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.580
It's time for the true awakening...

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:15.960
of the Book of Darkness's master.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.260
No...

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.970
It's time to end its cursed fate.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:31.190
Nanoha-chan... Fate-chan...?

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:33.730
Wh-What is this...?

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.150
You're very ill.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.690
Ill with the disease called the
"Curse of the Book of Darkness."

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:41.990
It... can't be cured.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:47.740
Even if the Book of Darkness is
completed, you won't survive.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:51.750
You have absolutely no chance of surviving.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.430
That's... fine...

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.510
Let Vita go...

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.890
What did you do to Zafira...?

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.180
You mean these two?

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:11.310
They're broken.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.730
They were broken even before we did this.

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:16.900
They still thought they could use the
functions of the Book of Darkness,

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:21.030
which were broken a long time ago,
yet they continued with their futile efforts.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.360
What do you mean, "futile"?!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.530
Where are Signum and Shamal?!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:41.300
Broken programs are useless.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.050
We thought we'd erase them.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:46.140
Huh? Wait! Stop!

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.640
If you want to stop us...

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.640
...come and make us.

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:54.690
Why?! Why?!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.150
Why is this happening?!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.110
Guess what, Hayate-chan?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:02.400
Destiny is a cruel thing.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:05.110
No! Stop!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.910
Stop!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.640
Good morning, Master.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.730
Hayate-chan!

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:36.690
Hayate!

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:07.590
I am the master of the Book of Darkness.
Bring power to these hands of mine.

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:13.310
Seal, release.

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:14.850
Releasing.

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:52.800
Once more... it's all ending once more.

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:56.980
How many times must I repeat this grief?

00:22:56.980 --> 00:22:58.810
Hayate-chan!

00:22:58.810 --> 00:22:59.850
Hayate...

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:02.860
I am the Book of Darkness.

00:23:02.860 --> 00:23:05.320
I will use all of my power...

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:10.410
Diabolic Emission.

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:25.880
...to grant my master's wish.

00:25:09.360 --> 00:25:12.690
Surrounded by grief, the Book of
Darkness releases all of its power.

00:25:12.690 --> 00:25:15.950
Its feelings have been imprisoned by chains.

00:25:15.950 --> 00:25:19.030
When its countless pasts
and destinies intertwine...

00:25:20.330 --> 00:25:24.830
its sorrowful melody continues
to reverberate in the night sky.

00:25:24.830 --> 00:25:28.380
Next time on
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A's:

00:25:28.380 --> 00:25:29.840
Episode 10:

00:25:29.840 --> 00:25:30.960
Destiny.

00:25:30.960 --> 00:25:33.260
Drive Ignition.
